ve - also known as DD - is calculated based on the difficulty of the execution of each manoeuvre and the junction of each dive component.","rbcd.infographic.4b.content":"Type of take off, Number of somersaults, Number of twists, Position during the somersault, Type of entry","rbcd.infographic.5.caption":"Scores","rbcd.infographic.5.content":"from all four rounds are accumulated for the final competition result.","rbcd.infographic.6.caption":"Points per Competition","rbcd.infographic.6.content":"are tallied towards the total score and standings of the World Series. All individual competition results count for the World Series overall ranking.","rbcd.infographic.7.caption":"Points","rbcd.infographic.7.content":"Points are awarded from the first to last place, including wildcards.","rbcd.panel.caption.worldseries":"World Series","rbcd.rail.caption.divers":"Permanent Divers","rbcd.rail.caption.events":"Events","rbcd.rail.caption.female-divers":"Women Divers","rbcd.rail.caption.greatestofcd":"The best of Red Bull Cliff Diving","rbcd.rail.caption.male-divers":"Men Divers","rbcd.rail.caption.results":"Results","rbcd.rail.caption.wildcards":"Wildcard Divers","rbcd.sponsors_panel.caption":"Global Partners","rbes.global.showless":"Show less","rbes.global.showmore":"Show more","rbes.profile.stats.wins":"Wins","rbsc.artists":"Artists","rbsc.event.info":"Event Info","rbsc.gallery":"Gallery","rbtv_discover_page.title":"Red Bull TV - Discover the latest films, shows & videos","rbtv_navigation_clips":"Clips","rbtv_navigation_discover":"Discover","rbtv_navigation_films":"Films","rbtv_navigation_live-events":"Live","rbtv_navigation_shows":"Shows","service-embed.cookie-settings":"Cookie Settings","shop.cta.buy_now":"Buy Now","shop.cta.go_to_shop":"Go to Shop","smart.collection.rail.continue_watching":"Continue watching","smart.collection.rail.favorites":"Favorites","smart.collection.rail.PodcastShows":"Discover more podcasts from the World of Red Bull","smart.collection.rail.popular_s